# What `vercel deploy` must never upload. The Vercel CLI does not read .gitignore, so secrets and private
# material are listed here. The web build needs only the workspace, packs/ and a few docs/ files.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
internal/
deploy/gpu-server/keys/
deploy/gpu-server/usage/
*.pem
*.key
Afribit_Chatbot_PRD.md
*.docx
infra/LUNANODE.md
apps/api/src/db/data/extract/
apps/web/.lighthouseci/
apps/web/dist-ssr/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
